@format 1
@id edit.change-persistence
@title Change edit persistent setting
@area Edit
@entry input
@summary Change a Crop, tone, or Skip Persistent setting and propagate the carried portion of the current Edit plan to listed sources.
@flow TB
@related edit.restore-plan, edit.save-plan

@alias inspector = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInspector
@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PEditTab
@alias edit = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LEdit

[input] Persistent setting changes <input>
- Publish a Crop-specific persistent-state change @ inspector.PInspectorPersistentRaise(...)
- Publish any prepared persistent-setting change @ inspector.PInspectorPersistentPrepare(...)
> guard

[guard] Check whether a carried plan exists <decision>
- Suppress propagation while plans are restoring or no persistent portion is selected @ tab.PEditPersistentWrite(...)
? "No carried plan can be formed" > unchanged
? "A carried plan is available" > propagate

[propagate] Save carried plan for listed sources <storage>
- Read each source's existing plan and merge the carried Crop, tone, and Skip portions @ edit.LEditPlanRead(...)
@ edit.LEditPlanResolve(...)
- Save the merged plan for every listed source @ edit.LEditPlanSave(...)
> result

[result] Persistent edit state propagated <output>
= Each listed source receives the selected persistent parts of the current Edit plan.

[unchanged] Propagation suppressed <output>
= Existing source plans remain unchanged.
